+- **Why:** Independent acceptance and review catch self-confirmation; forcing the test author into another dispatch does not create independence when the same outcome owner can preserve the original criterion, RED evidence and examiner integrity.
+- **Verification:** Preserve the original red and corrected green results as machine evidence. Test-path protection is a source/runtime capability with a known limitation: PreToolUse hook `guard-testpath.mjs` blocks Edit/Write on configured protected paths, while Bash/PowerShell writes are not covered. This operating rule does not claim that the current hook authenticates owner-written regression tests or enforces all test-path writes.
 
